# Edition-Tv Frontend Environment Variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# This file documents the environment variables used by the frontend apps.
# DO NOT commit real secrets here.
# Configure these variables in your hosting dashboard (e.g. Cloudflare Pages).

# The backend API URL for client-side and server-side fetching
# For production, this should point to the Render backend:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://edition-tv-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://edition-tv-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
